{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 19,
  "name": {
    "ja": "破滅のクエスト１",
    "en": "Doom Quest 1",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_ALL",
    "level": 15,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "冒険者様、あなたの力をお貸し下さい。この街の北西に",
          "穴が口を開け、その中で奇妙な悪魔どもがうごめいています。",
          "住民の一人がそうと知らずに入り込み、命からがら逃げ帰って",
          "来ました！どうか悪魔を打ち倒し、これまで通り平和な街にして下さい。",
          "さもなければ我々は確実に破滅することになるでしょう。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "We need your help, adventurer.  A hole has opened up to the",
          "northwest of our town, and strange demons lurk within.  One",
          "of our townspeople investigated it unwittingly and barely ",
          "escaped with his life!  Please destroy these demons and ",
          "ensure the continued safety of our town, else we are surely",
          "doomed.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "悪魔どもを退治して下さって有難うございます！",
          "ささやかなお礼を外に用意しておきました。",
        ],
        "en": ["Thank you for killing the demons! A small reward", "awaits you outside."],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["既に他の者に仕事を任せてあります。しばらく私を一人にさせてください！"],
        "en": ["I've sent out someone else to do the job.  Now leave me alone!"],
      },
    },
  ],
  "legend": {
    "a": {
      "terrain": "FLOOR",
